/1757000000000-AddTxCodeAttemptTracking.ts:72\n                        \n                    \n\n\n            \n                \n\n                            \n                                Parameters :\n                                \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            Name\n                                                Type\n                                            Optional\n                                        \n                                    \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                queryRunner\n                                            \n                                                        QueryRunner\n                                            \n\n                                            \n                                                    No\n                                            \n\n\n                                        \n                                    \n                                \n                            \n                        \n                            Returns :     Promise\n\n                        \n                            \n                                \n                            \n                \n            \n        \n    \n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    \n                            Public\n                            Async\n                        up\n                        \n                    \n                \n            \n            \n                \n                        \n                    up(queryRunner: QueryRunner)\n                \n            \n\n\n                    \n                        \n                            Defined in src/database/migrations/1757000000000-AddTxCodeAttemptTr